  "price_note": "Verified pricing at Honey Honey Lab (Australia) on 2026-09-06: 2-in-1 ESP32+nRF24 from A$15 (~US$10), 3-in-1 ESP32+nRF24+CC1101 from A$25 (~US$16), 3-in-1 with screen A$149 (~US$97), and the ESP32-C5 'Apex 5' from A$122 (~US$79, sold out). Other live sellers on the same date: MTools Tec, rek5lab and FlipMods on Tindie, and Elecrow. Unbranded AliExpress versions of the same open TSGP design sell for less. Treat this as a category with a US$10-100 spread, not a single SKU.",
