   "gpio": "14-pin breakout = 11 ESD-protected GPIO (RP2040 16, 17, 21, 22, 23, 24, 25, 26, 27, 28, 29) + 2 GND + 3.3V. GPIO 8-15 and 18-20 are consumed internally by the video output. Pins 23/24/25/29 are used internally on a real Pico but are free here.",
