   "battery_note": "No battery - powered from the Flipper's 3.3V rail or its own USB-C port. Module datasheet draw at 3.3V is 298-340mA TX / 81-88mA RX, so sustained scanning is a heavy load on the Flipper's cell.",
   "charging": "USB-C (data + power, direct to the ESP32)",
