  "price_note": "Great Scott Gadgets retired it in December 2022 after 12 years and 17 production runs and has no plans to make more. The $125 unit at Hacker Warehouse is explicitly described by that reseller as a clone of the open-source design, not a GSG-manufactured board. The design files are public, so anyone can build one.",
